  "body": "Tender: Closes on Thursday 12 November 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nAfter more than 45 years in the same hands, this solid brick and tile two-bedroom unit is being offered to the market for the very first time.\r\n\r\nPositioned in the middle of a block of three, this home is presented in its original condition (with the exception of insulation added in the ceiling and underfloor); a true blank canvas awaiting an artist’s impression. Underneath, a large single garage provides secure parking and exceptional storage.\r\n\r\nWhether you are an investor, a tradie looking for your next project, or a first-home buyer or retiree prepared to roll up your sleeves, this is an incredible opportunity to secure a prime Milford address at an accessible price point.\r\n\r\nLocation is key here. Stroll to the local shops at the top of Stanley Ave or enjoy a short walk or drive down to the Milford Marina, Beach, Mall, and vibrant local amenities, with quick access to the motorway making commuting effortless.\r\n\r\nBest of all, the property sits in a highly sought-after educational footprint, widely known as the Double Westlake Zone. You are in zone for Milford Primary School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, and both Westlake Boys and Girls High Schools.\r\n\r\nRenovate now, add serious value, and reap the rewards for years to come—you won’t regret it!",
